/// * `vg_aes_encrypt_blocks_aesni` (`Impl/Aes/X86/AesNiBlocks.lean`; AES-ECB,
///   and what XTS and OCB call): `ecur`, as emitted before the change, six
///   blocks a turn in xmm0 to xmm5 and then one at a time in xmm0; `e7t`,
///   seven a turn, with xmm7, and then the blocks left as four (xmm0 to
///   xmm3), two (xmm4, xmm5) and one (xmm7), each once; `e6t`, six a turn
///   as it is, and then the blocks left as three (xmm0 to xmm2), two (xmm3,
///   xmm4) and one (xmm5), each once; `efin`, where present, the function
///   as committed.
/// * `vg_aes_decrypt_blocks_aesni` (the same file): `gcur`, `g7t`, `g6t`
///   and `gfin`, likewise; `g6k`, `g6t` with each round key taken through
